<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - Aug 26.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - Aug 26.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in kerb bond deals through the Warsaw bourse was at 5.2 million zlotys on Monday, down from 216.3 million zlotys on Friday.</p>
<p>On Monday, 1,500 variable-interest, 10-year bonds maturing on July 18, 2006 traded at 100.4 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
